hadiths[213]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2523","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''insan ki sari baaten uskey liye wabal hain un mein sey usey Amr bil Maaroof, nahi Anil-munkar aur zikre Ilaahi key siwa usey kisi aur ka sawab nahin milega.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai isey hum sirf Muhammad bin Yazeed bin Khunais ki riwayat sey jantey hain."
"2524","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Salman aur Abu-Darda key maa-bain bhai chaara karwaya to eik din Salman ney Abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ki ziyaarat ki, dekha ke un ki biwi Umme Darda maamuli kapdo mein malboos (pehne hue) hain, chunanche unhoney puchha ke tumhari is haalat ki kya wajeh hai? unki biwi ney jawab diya : tumharey bhai Abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ko duniya sey koi raghbat nahin hai ke jab Abu-Darda ghar aaye to pehley unhoney Salman (Raziallahu anhu) key samney khana pesh kiya aur kaha : khaao mein aaj rozey sey hun. Salman (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : main nahin khaaunga yahan tak ke tum bhi merey sath khaao. chunanche Salman ney bhi khaya. phir jab raat aai to Abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) tahajjud padhney key liye khadey ho gaey, to Salman ney un sey kaha : sau jaao wo sau gaey. phir tahajjud padhney key liye khadey huye to kaha sau jaao, chunanche wo so gaey, phir jab subah qarib hui to Salman ney un sey kaha : ab uth jaao chunanche dono ney uth kar namaz padhi. phir Salman ney un sey kaha : ''tumharey jism ka bhi tum par haq hai, tumharey rab ka tum par haq hai, tumharey mehman ka tum par haq hai, tumhari biwi ka bhi tum par haq hai, isliye har sahibe haq ko uska haq ada karo.''  iskey baad dono Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir huye aur aap sey us guftgu ka tazkira kiya to aap ney farmaya : ''Salman ney sach kaha.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees sahih hai."
"2525","un sey Madina key eik shakhs ney bayan kiya : Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ney Ummul-momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) key paas eik khat likha ke mujhey eik khat likhye aur is mein kuchh wasiyat kijiye lekin bahut zyada nahin. chunanche Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) ney Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) key paas khat likha : dua aur salam key baad malum ho ke mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko ye farmatey huye suna hai : ''jo logon ki narazagi mein Allah Taala ki raza ka Talib ho to logon sey pahunchney wali takleef key silsiley mein Allah uskey liye kafi hoga aur jo Allah ki narazagi mein logon ki raza ka Talib ho to Allah Taala unhin logon ko usey takleef deney key liye muqarrar kar dega.''  (والسلام"
"2526","Abu Horairah (raziyallahu anho) ne rivaayat kiya: \Hum ne arz ki: 'Ya Rasoolallah! Hamaari kya baat hai ke jab hum aap ke saath hote hain to hamaare dil narm ho jaate hain aur hum duniya se bezaar mahsoos karte hain"
"2527",": Ubayy ibn Ka'b narrated that the Messenger of Allah ﷺ used to stand up when two-thirds of the night had passed and say: ""O people! Remember Allah, remember Allah! The Rajifah (the first blast of the Trumpet which shakes everything) has come, followed by the Radifah (the second blast which follows it). Death has come with what it contains; death has come with what it contains."" Ubayy said: I said, ""O Messenger of Allah! I send much Salat (blessings/salutations) upon you; how much of my Salat should I allocate for you?"" He said: ""Whatever you wish."" I said, ""One-fourth?"" He said: ""Whatever you wish, but if you increase it, it is better for you."" I said, ""One-half?"" He said: ""Whatever you wish, but if you increase it, it is better for you."" I said, ""Two-thirds?"" He said: ""Whatever you wish, but if you increase it, it is better for you."" I said, ""Shall I make all my Salat for you?"" He said: ""Then your worries will be taken care of and your sins will be forgiven."" Abu 'Isa (At-Tirmidhi) said: This is a Hasan Hadith."""
"2528","Abu Bakr bin 'Abdullah bin Qais ne apne walid se riwayat ki, aur woh farmaya ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak...\"""""""
"2529","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jannat mein...\"""""""
"2530","Mu'adh bin Jabal (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Jis ne Ramadan ke roze rakhe..."""""
"2531","Ubadah bin As-Samit (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jannat mein...\"""""""
"2532","Abu Sa'eed (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan Jannat mein darjaat hain"
"2533","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak...\"""""""
"2534","Qutaybah ne hamain bataya, Abu Ṣafwān ne hamain bataya, Yūnus se, al-Zuhrī se, Ḥumayd ibn ʿAbd al-Raḥmān se, ʿAbd al-Raḥmān ibn ʿAwf se, unhone farmaya:\n\n\Hum Rasool Allah"
"2535","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Be-shak Jannat mein pehle dastay ke log aise honge jaise raat-e-mehakti (poori chandni ki) ka chand. Doosra dastay aasmaan ke sab se khoobsurat (sab se chamakta) sitaare ki tarah nazar aayega. Har mard ke do biwiyan hon gi.\"""""""
"2536","Hazrat Anas (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Mom ko jannat mein itni aur itni taaqat (qudrat) di jayegi.\"" Poochha gaya: \""Ya Rasoolallah! Kya woh is par qadir hoga?\"" Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \""Usein so (100) aadmi ki taaqat de di jayegi.\"""""""
"2537","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jannat mein pehle dakhl hone wale log aise honge jaise raat ke poora chand (ke chamakne wale) honge.\"""""""
"2538","Dawud bin Amir bin Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas ne apni taraf se riwayat ki"
"2539","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jannat walon ke badan par baal nahi honge.\"""""""
"2540","Abu Sa'eed (rz all anh) nay allh taalyٰ kay frman:\n\n\awr tkht\""\n\nkay baray myn rwayt ky۔"""""
"2541","Asma' bint Abi Bakr (radiyAllahu 'anhaa) ne riwaayat ki: \Main ne RasoolAllah (sallAllahu alaihi wa sallam) ko sunaa jab woh Sidrat-ul-Muntaha ka zikr farma rahe the...\"""""""
"2542","Anas bin Malik (r.a.) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (s.a.w.) se pucha gaya: \Al-Kawthar kya hai?\"" Aap (s.a.w.) ne farmaya: \""Yeh ek nadi hai jo Mujhe Allah ne di hai\"" — yeh"""""
"2543","Sulaiman bin Buraidah ne apni walid se riwayat ki ke ek shakhs ne Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) se poocha: \Ya Rasool Allah (ﷺ)!"""""
"2544","Abu Ayyub (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke ek Badawi Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aya aur arz kya: \Ya Rasool Allah!\"""""""
"2545","Mu'adh bin Jabal (razi) riwayat karte hain ke Nabi (s.a.w) ne farmaya: \Jannat ke log Jannat mein bilkul ghareer (bina un ke jism ke bal) dakhil honge.\"""""""""""""
"2546","Ibn Buraidah ne apni walid se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Jannat ke log baees (120) safon mein honge.\"""""""
"2547","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Hum Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath ek khaime mein the."""""
"2548","Salim bin Abdullah (razi Allahu anhu) ne apne baap Abdullah bin Umar (razi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Jis darwaze se meri Ummat Jannat mein dakhil hogi"
"2549","Qutaybah ne riwayat ki, Abū ʿAwānah ne riwayat ki, Qatādah se, Abū Burdah ibn Abī Mūsā se, apne wālid se, unhone farmāyā: \Ai mere beta"
"2550","Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Be-shak Jannat mein ek baazaar hai jahan kharid-o-farokht nahin hoti - magar mardon aur auraton ki suratain (tasweerain) hoti hain. Pas jab koi mard kisi surat ki tamanna karta hai...\"""""""
"2551","Jarir bin 'Abdullah Al-Bajali (razi Allahu 'anhu) ne riwayat kiya: \Hum Nabi ﷺ ke baithay huay thay jab aap ﷺ ne raat ke purn chaand ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: 'Yaqeenan tum apne Rubb ke saamne khade kiye jaoge aur usko is chaand ki tarah dekhoge. Tum usko baghair kisi mushkil ke dekhoge. Pas agar tum is qader kar sakte ho ke doophone se pehle aur ghuroob se pehle ki namaz se ghafil na ho"
"2552","Suhaib (raziyallahu anho) ne Allah Ta'ala ke is qaul ke mutaaliq rivaayat farmaya: \Jin ne neki ki"
"2553","Hārithah ibn Muḍarrib (RaziAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) se marwi hai:\n\nUnhon ne farmaya: \Hum Khabbāb (RaziAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) ke paas un ki sehat ke baare mein poochhne aaye"
"2554","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Kya tum aapas mein zor lagate ho taake poori raat ke chaand ko dekho? Kya tum aapas mein zor lagate ho taake sooraj ko dekho?\"" Unhon ne kaha: \""Nahi.\"" Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \""Pas yaqeenan...\"""""""
"2555","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ki Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak...\"""""""
"2556","Ibn-e-Ishaaq ibn-e-Moosaa al-Ansaari ne riwaayat ki, Muhammad ibn-e-Ma'n al-Madanee al-Ghifaari ne riwaayat ki, mere baap ne mujhe riwaayat ki, Sa'eed al-Maqbari se, Abu Hurairah (Razi Allahu Anho) se, Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Shukar karne waala khaana khaane waala"
"2557","Abu Hurairah (radiy Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke din Allah ta'alaa tamam insaanon ko ek hi maidaan mein jamaa karega.\"""""""
"2558","Attiyah (raziyallahu anho) ne Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu anho) se marfu' tariqah se riwayat farmaya ke: \Jab Qayamat ka din aaye ga...\"""""""""""""
"2559","Hazrat Anas (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jannat mushkilon se ghirri hui hai.\"""""""
"2560","Abu Hurairah (raziAllahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke Rasoolullah (sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jab Allah ne Jannat aur Jahannam ko paida kiya...\"""""""
"2561","Abu Hurairah (raziAllahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke Rasoolullah (sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jannat aur Jahannam ne aapas mein jhagda kiya. Jannah ne kaha: 'Kamzor aur ghareeb log mujhe (Jannat mein) daakhil honge.'"""""
"2562","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jannat ke sab se kam darje wale shakhs ke paas assi hazaar naukar aur bahattar biwiyan honge. Us ke liye ek moti ka khaima hoga...\"""""""
"2563","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Momin...\"""""""
"2564","Hazrat Ali (r.a.) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (s.a.w.) ne farmaya: \Be-shak mein Jannat mein Al-Hur Al-'Ein ke liye ek majlis hai jahan woh apni aawaazein uncha karte hain. Makhlooqaat ne aise (awaaz) kabhi nahi suni thi.\"" (Hazrat Ali (r.a.) ne kaha:) \""Woh kehti hain: 'Hum hamesha rehne waliyan hain"
"2565","Hannād ne hamain bayan farmaya: Abū al-Aḥwaṣ ne hamain riwāyat ki, Layth se, Shahr ibn Ḥawshab se, ʿAbd al-Raḥmān ibn Ghanm se, aur Abū Dharr (raḍiyallāhu ʿanh) se, unhone farmāyā:\n\nRasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmayā:\n\n> Allāh Taʿālā farmatā hai: \A mere bando! Tum sab gumrāh ho"
"2566","Abdullah ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Teen shakhs mushk ki dharton par honge\"" — mujhe lagta hai unhone kaha: \""Qayamat ke din. Pehle aur aakhir sab log unhe hasad karenge: Aadmi jo rozana paanchon namazon ki pukarta rahe raat din; aur aadmi jo kisi giroh ki imamat kare aur woh usse raazi hon.\"""""""
"2567","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (radiyallahu anhu) ek Marfu' rivaayat bayan farmaate hain: \Teen aise log hain jinke liye Allah Ta'ala"""""
"2568","Abu Dharr (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya ki Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Teen aise log hain jinko Allah muhabbat karta hai aur teen aise log hain jinko Allah nafrat karta hai. Allah ki muhabbat karne walon mein se ek yeh hai ke koi aisi qaum ke paas aaye aur Allah ki bharose mein us se kuch maange...\"""""""
"2569","Abu Hurairah (R.A.) ne riwayat ki hai ke Rasool Allah (S.A.W.) ne farmaya: \Jald hi Dajla (Furat) ek sone ka khazana nikaley ga.\"""""""
"2570","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne is jaisi hi aur baat farmayi."
"2571","Qutaybah ne hamain bataya, Ibn Luha'iyyah ne hamain bataya, Yazid ibn 'Amr al-Mu'afiri se, Abu 'Abd ar-Rahman al-Hubuli se, aur Abdullah ibn 'Amr se riwayat kiya ki: Rasool Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: \Jo khamosh rahay"
"2572","Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \n\Jo shaks teen martaba Allah ta'ala se Jannat maange"
"2573","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Us Din (Qayamat ke Din) Jahannam pesh kiya jayega"
"2574","Abu Hurairah (R.A.) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke din Dozakh se (garde ke shakl mein) Dozakh niklegi. Uske aankhen hongein jo dekh sakti hain"
"2575","Ahmad ibn Mani' ne hum se rivayat kiya, Muhammad ibn al-Hasan ibn Abi Yazid al-Hamdani ne Thawr ibn Yazid se, Khalid ibn Ma'dan se, Mu'adh ibn Jabal se, ke Rasoolullah ﷺ ne farmaya: ""Jo apne bhai ko uske gunah par taana mare (uyi kare), wo nahi marega jab tak wo usi gunah ko na kar le."" Ahmad ne kaha: ""Wo gunah jis se usne tauba kar li ho."" Abu Isa ne farmaya: Ye hadith gharib hai aur iska isnad muttaasil (musalsal) nahi. Khalid ibn Ma'dan ne Mu'adh ibn Jabal ko nahi paya (unke zamane mein nahi mile). Aur Khalid ibn Ma'dan se marwi hai ke unhonne Nabi ﷺ ke 70 sahaba ko paya. Mu'adh ibn Jabal Umar ibn al-Khattab ki khilafat mein wafat pae, aur Khalid ibn Ma'dan ne Mu'adh ke ashab ke zariye ghair ek se Mu'adh se ahadith rivayat kiye hain."
"2576","Abu Sa'eed (radiyAllahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya: \As-Saud aag ka ek pahad hai.\"""""""
"2577","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan munkir ka jild bawees zira' (forearm) lambi hogi.\"""""""
"2578","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Qayamat ke din kafir ka daant (moral tooth) Uhud pahad jaisa hoga.\"""""""
"2579","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne marfu' hadith rawaiyat farmate hain ke: \Kafar ke daant Uhud (pahari) ke barabar honge.\"""""""
"2580","Ibn 'Umar (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak kafir ki zaban ko ek farsakh ya do farsakh tak kheench jaegi.\"""""""
"2581","Abu Sa'eed (رَضِيَ اللَّهُ عَنْهُ) ne Allah Ta'ala ke is qaul ke mutaalliq rivayat ki hai: \Kal Mahl\"" (یعنی موم کی طرح پتلا مائع جو کہ حیوانات کے پیٹ سے نکلتا ہے)۔"""""
"2582","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan unke sar par Hamim (garm pani) unchaal diya jayega. Woh Hamim andar tak jayegi jab tak usay uske aanton tak pahunch jaye. Phir jo kuch uske andar hoga woh bahar gir jayega jab tak uske pairon par beh jayega jab tak woh pighal jaye. Phir woh usi tarah dobara banaya jayega jaisa woh tha.\"""""""
"2583","Abu Umamah (raziyallahu anho) ne Allah Ta'ala ke is qaul ke mutaalliq rivaayat ki hai ke: \Usey sadid (naak mein jaaney wala paseene ka paani) pilaya jayega.\"""""""
"2584","Hanzalah Usayyidī (Raziyallāhu Anhū) se riwāyat hain, jo Rasūlullāh ﷺ ke kātib mein se the:\n\nUnho ne Abū Bakr (Raziyallāhu Anhū) ke paas se guzarte hue unhe rote hue dekhā. Abū Bakr ne pūchhā, \Tumhein kyā ho gayā"
"2585","Ibn 'Abbas (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aayat tilawat ki: \Allah ka taqwa rakho"
"2586","Abu Ad-Darda' (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \dwzk kay rhnay walwn kw ayk aysy bhwk ka samna krna pray ga jw an kw mlnay walay azab kay brabr hwgy۔\"""""""
"2587","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (radiyAllahu 'anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallAllahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Aur unhon ne wahan apni honton ko ulta kar liya hoga. -Jahannam ki aag mein woh aag se paka jayega"
"2588","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-As (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ne farmaya: \Agar aisi goli (yaani itni chhoti si cheez)...\"""""""
"2589","Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Yeh aag tumhari...\"""""""
"2590","Abu Sa'eed (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Yeh tumhari aag jahannum ki aag ke sattar hisson mein se ek hi hissa hai.\"""""""
"2591","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Aag hazaar saal tak jalayi gayi yahan tak ke woh laal ho gayi.\"""""""
"2592","Abu Horaira (raz.) rivayat karte hain ki Rasoolullah (s.a.w.) ne farmaya: \Jahannam ne apne Rabb se shikayat ki. Usne kaha: 'Mujhe apne baaz hisse aur baaz hisse ko kha jaate hain.' Toh Allah Ta'ala ne usse do saans lene ki ijazat di: ek saans sardi (winter) mein aur ek saans garmi (summer) mein.\"""""""
"2593","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jis ka maqsad aakhirat ki zindagi ho Allah Taala uskey dil mein beniyazi aur beparwaahi paida kar deta hai, aur usey dil jamai ata karta hai padhi. , aur duniya uskey paas zaleel ho kar aati hai aur jis ka maqsad talabe duniya ho, Allah Taala uski mohtaji uski dono aakhon key samney rakh deta hai aur uski dil jamai ko pareshan kar deta hai aur duniya uskey paas itni hi aati hai jo uskey liye muqaddar hai.''"
"2594","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah taala farmata hai : ibne-Adam ! to meri ibadat key liye yaksu ho ja, main tera Sina beniyaazi aur beparwaahi sey bhar dunga, aur teri mohtaji door karunga, aur agar tu ney aisa na kiya to main tera dil mashghooliyat sey bhar dunga aur teri mohtaji door na karunga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"2595","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki wafat hui, us waqt hamarey paas thodi si jau thi, phir jitni muddat tak Allah Taala ney chaha hamney usi sey khaya , phir hamney laundi ko jau tolney key liye kaha, to usney tola , phir baqiya jau bhi jald hi khatam ho gaey, lekin agar hum usey chhod detey aur na tolte to is mein sey us sey ziyada muddat tak khatey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- yahan Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) key qol «"
"2596","hamarey paas eik bareek parda tha jis par taswiren bani thin, parda merey darwazey par latak raha tha, jab usey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney dekha to farmaya : ''is ko yahan sey door kar do isliye ke ye mujhey duniyaa ki yad dilata hai.'' , Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) kehti hain : hamarey paas eik ro'ein daar purani chadar thi jis par resham key nishaanaat baney huye they aur usey hum audhte they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai."
"2597","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas chamdey ka eik takiya ( bistar ( tha jis par aap aaram farmatey they is mein khajoor ki patli chhaal bhari hui thi. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees sahih hai."
"2598","ney eik bakri zibeh ki, Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney puchha ''is mein sey kuchh baqi hai?'' Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) ney kaha : dasti key siwa aur kuch nahin baqi hai, aap ney farmaya : ''dasti key siwa sab kuchh baqi hai.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees sahih hai."
"2599","hum aale Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ( aisey they ke eik eik mahina choolhaa nahin jalaatey they, hamara guzar basar sirf khajoor aur pani par hota tha. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees sahih hai."
"2600","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''mujhey Allah ki raah mein aisa daraya gaya ke is tarah kisi ko nahin daraya gaya aur Allah ki raah mein mujhey aisi takleefen pahunchaai gaee hain ke is tarah kisi ko nahin pahunchaai gaeen , mujh par musalsal tees din aur raat guzar jatey aur merey aur Bilal key liye koi khana nahin hota ke jisey koi jaan wala khaye siwaye thodi si chiz key jisey Bilal apni baghal mein chhupa letey they.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2ـ is hadees mein wo din murad hain ke jab aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ehale Makka sey bezar ho kar Makka sey nikal gaey they aur sath mein Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) they, unkey paas kuchh khana tha jisey wo baghal mein dabaaey huye they."
"2601","eik thandey din mein Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key ghar sey main nikla aur sath main eik badbudar chamdaa ley liya jis key baal jhadey huye they, phir beech sey mainey usey kaat kar apni gardan mein dal liya aur apni kamar ko khajoor ki shaakh sey baandh diya, mujhey bahut sakht bhook lagi hui thi, agar Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key ghar mein kuchh khana hota to main is mein sey zarur kha leta , chunanche main kuchh khaney ki talash mein nikla , raastey main eik Yahudi key paas sey guzra jo apney baagh mein charkhi sey pani dey raha tha, us ko mainey deewar ki eik surakh sey jhaankaa to usney kaha : Erabi (dehati) (dehaati) ! kya baat hai? kya to eik khajoor par eik dol pani kheencheyga? mainey kaha : haan , aur apna darwaza khol do taake main andar aa jaaun, usney darwaza khol diya aur main dakhil ho gaya, usney mujhey apna dol diya, phir jab bhi main eik dol pani nikalta to wo eik khajoor mujhey deta yahan tak ke jab meri mutthi bhar gaee to mainey uska dol chhod diya aur kaha ke itna merey liye kafi hai, chunanche mainey usey khaya aur do teen ghoont pani piya , phir main masjid mein aaya aur wahin Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko mojud paya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"2602","Sahaba ko eik martaba bhook lagi to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney un sab ko sirf eik eik khajoor di. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2603","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamein teen sau ki tadaad mein bheja , hum apna apna zaade-safar (safar ka khaana) uthaey huye they, hamara zaade safar khatam ho gaya nobat yahan tak pahunch gaee ke har aadmi key hissey mein sirf eik eik khajoor aati thi, un sey kaha gaya : abu-Adbullah ! eik khajoor sey aadmi ka kya hota hoga? jab wo bhi khatam ho gaee to hamein uski qadr malum hui, unhoney farmaya : hum samandar key kinarey pahunchey aakhir hamein eik machhli mili , jisey samandar ney bahar phenk diya tha, chunanche hum is mein sey atthaara din tak jis tarah chaha sair ho kar khatey rahey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ye hadees Jabir key wastey sey dusri sanadon sey bhi marvi (riwayat hui) hai. 3- is hadees ko Malik bin Anas ney Wahab bin Kaisaan sey is sey ziyada mukammal aur lambi riwayat kiya hai."
"2604","hum Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath masjid mein bethey huye they ke Musab bin Umer padhi. aaye unkey badan par chamdey ki pewand lagi hui eik chadar thi, jab Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney unhen dekha to unki us naaz aur nemat ko dekh kar roney lagey jis mein wo pehley they aur jis haalat mein in dino they, phir Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''kya haal hoga tumhara us waqt jabke tum mein sey eik shakhs eik jodey mein subah kerega to doosrey jodey mein Sham kerega aur uskey samney eik bartan khaney ka rakha jaeyga to doosra uthaya jaeyga, aur tum apney makaanon mein aisey hi parda dalo gey jaisa ke Kaabe par parda dala jata hai?'' ,Sahaba ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! kya hum us waqt aaj sey bahut achvhhey hongey aur ibadat key liye farigh hongey aur mehnat aur mashaqqat sey bach jaeyngey? to Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''nahin , balke tum aaj key din un dino sey behtar ho.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- Yazeed bin Ziyad sey murad Yazeed bin Ziyad bin Maisraa Madni hain, un sey Malik bin Anas aur deegar ehle-ilm ney riwayat ki hai aur (doosrey) Yazeed bin Ziyad Dimashqi wo hain jinhoney Zohri sey riwayat kiya hai aur un sey (yani Dimashqi sey) Wakee aur Marwan bin Muawiya ney riwayat kiya hai, aur (teesrey) Yazeed bin Abi Ziyad Koofi hain."
"2605","ehale Suffa musalmanon key mehman they, wo maal aur ehal aur ayaal waley na they, qism hai us mabood ki jis key siwa koi mabood bar-haq nahin, bhook ki shiddat sey main apna pet zamin par rakh deta tha aur bhook sey pet par pathar baandh leta tha, eik din main logon ki guzargaah par beth gaya, us taraf sey abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) guzrey to mainey un sey Quran Majeed ki eik aayat is wajeh sey poochhi taake wo mujhey apney sath ley jaeyn lekin wo chaley gaey aur mujhey apney sath nahin liya, phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) guzrey , un sey bhi mainey kitabullah ki eik aayat poochhi taake wo mujhey apney sath ley jaeyn magar wo bhi aagey badh gaey aur mujhey apney sath nahin ley gaey. phir Abul-Qaasim Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ka guzar huwa to aap ney mujhey dekh kar muskuraayaa aur farmaya : ''Abu-Huraira ! ''main ney kaha : hazir hun Allah key Rasool ! aap ney farmaya : ''sath chalo'' aur aap chal padey, main bhi sath mein ho liya , aap apney ghar mein dakhil huye phir mainey bhi ijazat chahi , chunanche mujhey ijazat dey di gaee , wahan aap ney doodh ka eik piyala paya , daryaft farmaya : ''ye doodh kahan sey mila?'' arz kiya gaya : falan ney isey hadiya bheja hai, aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Abu-Huraira !'' mainey kaha : hazir hun, aap ney farmaya : ''jaao ehale Suffa ko bula laao.'' ,ye musalmanon key mehman they unka koi thikaana nahin tha, ghar-baar tha na koi maal, aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas jab koi sadqa aata tha to usey unkey paas bhej detey they, is mein sey aap kuchh nahin letey they, aur jab koi hadiya aata to unko bula bhejtey, is mein sey aap bhi kuchh ley letey, aur u ko bhi is mein shareek farmatey, lekin us zara sey doodh key liye aap ka mujhey bhejna nagawar guzra aur mainey (dil mein) kaha : ehale Suffa ka kya baneyga? aur main unhen bulaney jaaunga, phir aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam mujhey hi hukm dengey ke is piyaley mein jo kuchh hai unhen dun, mujhey yaqin hai ke is mein sey mujhey kuchh nahin milega , halanke mujhey ummid thi ke is mein sey mujhey itna zarur milega jo merey liye kafi ho jaeyga, lekin Allah aur uskey Rasool ki itaat key siwa koi chaara bhi na tha, chunanche main un sab ko bula laya , jab wo sab aap key paas aaye aur apni apni jagahon par beth gaey to aap ney farmaya : ''Abu-Huraira ! ye piyala un logon ko dey do.'' ,chunanche main wo piyala eik eik ko deney laga, jab eik shakhs pi kar sair ho jata to main doosrey shakhs ko deta yahan tak ke main Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam tak pahunch gaya, sari qom sair ho chuki thi (ya sab log sair ho chukey they) phir aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney wo piyala ley kar usey apney haath par rakha phir apna sar uthaya aur muskura kar farmaya : ''Abu-Huraira ! ye doodh piyo'' , chunanche mainey piya. phir aap ney farmaya : isey piyo main peeta raha aur aap yehi farmatey rahey yahan tak ke mainey kaha is zaat ki qism jisney aap ko haq ley kar bheja hai ab main peeney ki gunjaaish nahin paata, phir aap ney piyala liya , Allah ki hamd aur sanaa bayan ki aur Bismillah keh kar doodh piya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2606","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas eik shakhs ney dakaar liya, to aap ney farmaya : ''tum apni dakaar hum sey door rakho isliye ke duniya mein sab sey ziyada pet bhar kar khaney wala qiyamat key din sab sey ziyada bhookaa rahega.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib hai. 2- is bab mein abu-Juhaifa (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"2607","unhoney kaha : aey merey betey ! agar tum hamen us waqt dekhtey jab hum Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath they aur hamen barish nasib hoti thi to tum khayal kartey ke hamari boo bhaid ki boo jaisi hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees sahih hai. 2- is hadees ka matlab ye hai ke Sahaba key kapdey oon key hotey they, jab is par barish ka pani padta to us sey bhaid ki jaisi boo aaney lagti thi."
"2608","Ibrahim Nakhai kehtey hain : ghar makaan sab ka sab, har imarat, baaise wabal hai, mainey kaha is makaan key barey mein aap ka kya khayal hai, jisey banaey baghair chaara nahin unhoney kaha : na is mein koi ajr hai aur na koi gunah."
"2609","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo shakhs zeenat ka libas khalis Allah ki raza-mandi aur uski tawaazeh ki khatir chhod dey bawajud ye ke wo usey muyassar hai to Allah Taala aisey shakhs ko qiyamat key din tamam makhluq key samney bulaeyga taake wo ehale eman key libas mein sey jisey chahey pasand karey , aur pehney. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai. 2- « حلل"
"2610","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''nafqa (bharan poshan) sab ka sab Allah ki raah mein hai siwaye us nafqa key jo ghar bananey mein kharch hota hai kyonkey is mein koi khair nahin hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees gharib hai."
"2611","hum Khubab (Raziallahu anhu) key paas iyaadat karney key liye aaye , unhoney apney badan mein saat dagh lagwaa rakhey they, unhoney kaha : yaqinan mera marz bahut lamba ho gaya hai, agar main Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko ye farmatey na suna hota ke ''maut ki tamanna na karo'' ,to main zarur iski tamanna karta , aur aap ney farmaya : ''aadmi ko har kharch mein sawab milta hai siwaye mitti mein kharch karney key''  ,ya farmaya : ''ghar bananey mein.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2612","eik saail (sawaali) ney aa kar ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma sey kuchh maanga to ibne-Abbas ney saail (sawaali) sey kaha : kya tum ye gawahi detey ho ke Allah Taala key siwa koi mabood bar-haq nahin hai? usney kaha : haan , aap ney kaha : kya tum ye gawahi detey ho ke Muhammad Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam Allah key Rasool hain? usney kaha : haan , aap ney kaha : kya tum Ramzan key rozey rakhtey ho? usney kaha : haan , aap ney kaha : tum ney sawal kiya aur saail ka haq hota hai, beshak hamarey ooper zaruri hai ke hum tumharey sath husne-suluk karen, chunanche unhoney usey eik kapda diya aur kaha : mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko ye farmatey huye suna hai : ''jo koi musalman kisi musalman bhai ko koi kapda pehnaata hai to wo Allah ki aman mein us waqt tak rehta hai jab tak us kapdey ka eik tukda bhi is par baqi rehta hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib hai."
"2613","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam jab Madina tashrif laye to log aap ki taraf daud padey , aur kehney lagey : Allah key Rasool aagey , Allah key Rasool aagey , Allah key Rasool aagey , chunanche main bhi logon key sath aaya taake aap ko dekhun , phir jab mainey aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ka chehra Mubarak achchhi tarah dekha to pehchan gaya ke ye kisi jhootey ka chehra nahin ho sakta , aur sab sey pehli baat jo aap ney kahi wo ye thi ''logo ! salam phailao, khana khilaao aur raat mein jab log so rahey hon to namaz padho, tum log salamti key sath jannat mein dakhil ho'ogey.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees sahih hai."
"2614","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''khana kha kar Allah ka shukar ada karney wala ( ajr aur sawab mein) sabr karney waley roze daar key barabar hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"2615","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam jab Madina tashrif laye to aap key paas muhajrin ney aa kar arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! jis qom key paas hum aaye hain un sey badh kar hamney koi qom aisi nahin dekhi jo apney maal bahut ziyada kharch karney wali hai aur thodey maal honey ki surat mein bhi dusron key sath gham khawaari karney wali hai. chunanche unhoney hum ko mehnat aur mashaqqat sey baaz rakha aur hum ko aaram aur rahat mein shareek kiya yahan tak ke hamein khof hai ke hamari sari nekiyon ka sawab kahin unhin ko na mil jaey? Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''baat aisi nahin hai jaisa tum ney samjha hai jab tak tum log Allah sey unkey liye duaaey khair kartey rahogey aur unka shukriya ada kartey rahogey.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai."
"2616","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''kya main tumhen aisey logon ki khabar na dun jo jahannam ki aag par ya jahannam ki aag un par haram hai? jahannam ki aag logon key qarib rehney waley , aasani karney waley , aur naram akhlaq waley par haram hai.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"2617","mainey Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) sey puchha kya : Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam jab apney ghar mein dakhil hotey they to kya kartey they? kaha : aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam apney ghar walon key kaam kaaj mein mashghool ho jatey they, phir jab namaz ka waqt ho jata to khadey hotey aur namaz padhney lagtey they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2618","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key samney jab koi shakhs aata aur aap sey musaafa karta to aap apna haath uskey haath sey nahin nikaltey jab tak wo shakhs khud apna haath na nikal leta, aur aap apna rukh uski taraf sey nahin phertey, jab tak ke wo khud apna rukh na pher leta, aur aap ney apney kisi sathi key samney kabhi paaon nahin phelaey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees gharib hai."
"2619","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tum sey agli ummaton mein sey eik shakhs eik joda pehan kar is mein itraataa huwa nikla chunanche Allah Taala ney zamin ko hukm diya aur zamin ney us ko mazbooti sey pakad liya , isliye wo qiyamat key din tak zamin mein dhanstaa chala ja raha hai.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees sahih hai."
"2620","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''mutakabbir (ghamand karney waley) logon ko qiyamat key din maidane hashr mein chhoti chhoti chewntiyon key maanind logon ki Suraton mein laya jaeyga, unhen har jagah zillat dhaanpey rahegi, phir wo jahannam key eik aisey qaid khaney ki taraf haankey jaeyngey jis ka naam « بولس » hai. is mein unhen bhadakti hui aag ublegi, wo is mein jahannamiyon key zakhmon ki peep piyengey jisey « طينة"
"2621","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jisney ghussey par qabu paa liya us haal mein ke uskey kar guzarney par qadir tha, to qiyamat key roz Allah Taala usey tamam logon key samney bulaeyga aur ikhtiyar dega ke wo jannat ki hooron mein sey jisey chahey pasand kar ley.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"2622","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''teen khaslatein aisi hain ke ye jis key andar paai jaeyn to qiyamat key roz Allah apni rehmat key saye taley rakheyga, aur usey apni jannat mein dakhil kerega :(1) zaeefon key sath naram bartaao karey. (2) maa baap key sath shafqat aur mohabbat ka bartaao karey. (3) laundiyon aur ghulamon par ehsan kerey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"2623","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah taala farmata hai : aey merey bando ! tum sab gumrah ho, siwaye uskey jisey main hidayat dun, isliye tum sab mujh sey hidayat maango main tumhen hidayat dunga , aur tum sab key sab mohtaj ho siwaye uskey jisey main ghani (maaldaar) kar dun, isliye tum mujh hi sey maango main tumhen rizq dunga, aur tum sab gunehgar ho, siwaye uskey jisey main aafiyat dun to jisey ye malum hai ke main bakhshney par qadir hun phir wo mujh sey maghfirat chahta hai to main usey maaf kar deta hun, aur mujhey koi parwah nahin agar tumharey agley aur pichhley , tumharey zinde aur murdey aur tumharey khushk aur tar sab merey bandon mein sey sab sey ziyada muttaqi aur perhezgar bandey ki tarah ho jaeyn to bhi meri saltanat main eik machchhar key par barabar izafa na hoga, aur agar tumharey agley aur pichhley , tumharey zinde aur murdey aur tumharey khushk aur tar sab merey bandon mein sey sab sey ziyada dil ke sakht aur bad-bakht ki tarah ho jaeyn to bhi meri saltanat main eik machchhar key par barabar kami na hogi , aur agar tumharey agley aur pichhley , tumharey zinde aur murdey aur tumharey khushk aur tar sab eik hi zamin par jama ho jaeyn aur tum mein sey har insan mujh sey itna maangey jahan tak uski aarzuein pahunchein aur main tum mein sey har saail (sawaali) ko dey dun to bhi meri saltanat mein kuchh bhi farq waqey na hoga magar itna hi ke tum mein sey koi samandar key kinarey sey guzrey aur us main eik soi dubo kar nikal ley, aur aisa is wajeh sey hai ke main sakhi , buzurg hun, jo chahta hun karta hun, mera dena sirf keh dena , aur mera azab sirf keh dena hai, kisi chiz key liye jab main chahta hun to mera hukm yehi hai ke main kehta hun ''ho ja'' bas wo ho jati hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai. 2- baaz logon ney isi tarah is hadees ko ba-tareeq : (عن شهر بن حوشب an معدي كرب an أبي ذر an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) riwayat kiya hai."
"2624","mainey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey eik hadees suni hai agar mainey usey eik ya do baar suna hota yahan tak ke saat martaba guna to main usey tum sey bayan na karta , lekin mainey usey is sey ziyada martaba suna hai, aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam farma rahey they : ''bani Israel mein Kifl naami eik shakhs tha jo kisi gunah key karney sey perhez nahin karta tha, chunanche uskey paas eik aurat aai , usney isey saath (60) Dinar isliye diye ke wo us sey bad-kari kerega, lekin jab wo uskey aagey betha jaisa ke mard apni biwi key aagey bethta hai to wo kaanp uthi aur roney lagi, us shakhs ney puchha : tum kyon roti ho kya mainey tumharey sath zabardasti ki hai? wo boli : nahin, lekin aaj main wo kaam kar rahi hun jo mainey kabhi nahin kiya aur is kaam key karney par mujhey sakht zarurat ney majbur kiya hai, chunanche usney kaha : tum aisa ghalat kaam karney ja rahi hao jisey tum ney kabhi nahin kiya, isliye tum jaao , wo sab Dinar bhi tumharey liye hain, phir us shakhs ney kaha : Allah ki qism ! ab iskey baad main kabhi bhi Allah ki nafarmani nahin karunga , phir usi raat mein uska intiqal ho gaya, chunanche subah ko uskey darwazey par likha huwa tha ''beshak Allah Taala ney Kafl ko bakhsh diya.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai. 2- isey Sheban aur deegar logon ney Aamash sey isi tarah marfooan riwayat kiya hai, aur baaz logon ney isey Aamash sey ghair marfoo riwayat kiya hai, abu-Bakar bin Ayash ney is hadees ko Aamash sey riwayat kiya hai lekin is mein ghalati ki hai, aur « an Abdullah bin Abdullah an Saeed bin Juber an ibne-Umar » kaha hai jo ke ghair mehfooz hai."
"2625","hum sey Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ney do hadisein bayan kin , eik apni taraf sey aur dusri Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki taraf sey (yani eik maqoof aur dusri marfoo) Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : momin apney gunah ko aisa dekhta hai goya wo pahad ki jad mein hai. darta hai ke is par wo gir na padey, aur faajir apney gunah ko eik makkhi key maanind dekhta hai jo uski naak par bethi hui hai, usney haath sey ishara kiya aur wo ud gaee."
"2626","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''yaqeenan Allah tum mein sey eik shakhs ki tauba par us shakhs sey kahin ziyada khush hota hai jo kisi be-aabo-giyaah chatiyal maidan (registaan) mein hai aur uskey sath uski oontni hai jis par uska tosha , khana pani aur deegar zarooraton ki chiz rakhi hui hai, phir uski oontni kho jati hai aur wo usey dhoondney key liye nikal padta hai, yahan tak ke jab wo halakat key qarib pahunch jata hai to wo sochta hai : main usi jagah lot jaaun jahan sey meri oontni kho gaee thi, aur wahin mar jaaun chunanche wo lot kar usi jagah pahunchta hai, aur is par neend taari ho jati hai, phir jab bedaar hota hai to kya dekhta hai ke uski oontni uskey sar key paas mojud hai is par uska khana pani aur hajat ki chiz bhi mojud hai.''Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Abu-Hurera , Noman bin Bashir aur Anas bin Malik (Raziallauh anhum) ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey hadisein riwayat ki hain."
"2627","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''sarey insan khatakar hain aur khata-kaaron mein sab sey behtar wo hain jo tauba karney waley hain.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. 2- isey hum sirf Ali bin Musada hi ki riwayat sey jantey hain jisey wo Qatada sey riwayat kartey hain."
"2628","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho to usey chahiye ke wo apney mehman ki izzat karey, aur jo Allah aur youme aakhirat par eman rakhta ho to usey chahiye ke wo bhali baat kahey ya khamosh rahey.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Aaisha , Anas Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2629","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jo khamosh raha usney najat paai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. 2- isey hum sirf ibne-Lahiaa ki riwayat sey jantey hain."
"2630","mainey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key samney eik shakhs ki naqal ki to aap ney farmaya : ''mujhey ye pasand nahin ke main kisi insan ki naqal karun aur mujhey itna aur itna maal miley.'' mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! beshak Safiya eik aurat hain, aur apney haath sey is tarah ishara kiya, goya ye murad ley rahi thin ke Safiya pasta qad hain. aap ney farmaya : ''beshak tum ney apni baaton mein aisi baat Milaai hai ke agar isey samandar key pani mein mila diya jaey to uska rang badal jaey.''"
"2631","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''main ye nahin pasand karta ke main kisi insan ki naqal karun aur mujhey itna aur itna maal miley.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2632","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey puchha gaya ke musalmanon mein sab sey ziyada afzal kon hai? aap ney farmaya : ''jis ki zaban aur haath sey doosrey musalman mehfooz hon.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Abu-Musa ki riwayat sey is sanad sey sahih gharib hai."
"2633","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jisney apney kisi deeni bhai ko kisi gunah par aar (sharm) dilaaya to uski maut nahin hogi yahan tak ke us sey wo gunah sadir ho jaaey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. 2- iski sanad muttasil nahin hai, aur Khalid bin Maadaan ki mulaqat Muaz bin Jabal sey Sabit nahin hai, Khalid bin Maadaan sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai ke unhoney sattar Sahaba sey mulaqat ki hai, aur Muaz bin Jabal ki wafat umr bin Khattab ki khilaafat mein hui, aur Khalid bin Maadaan ney Muaz key kaee shagirdon key wastey sey Muaz sey kaee hadisein riwayat ki hai. 3- Ahmed bin Munee ney kaha : is sey wo gunah murad hai jis sey wo shakhs tauba kar chuka ho."
"2634","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''apney bhai key sath dushmani na karo, ho sakta hai ke Allah Taala is par reham karey aur tumhen aazmaaish mein dal dey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- Makhool ka samaa (sun'na), Waasila Isqaa', Anas bin Malik aur Abu Hind Daari sey Sabit hai, aur ye bhi kaha jata hai ke unka samaa (sun'na), in teeno Sahaba key ilawa kisi sey Sabit nahin hai. 3- ye Makhool Shaami hain unki kunniyat Abu-Adbullah hai, ye eik ghulam they baad mein unhen azad kar diya gaya tha. 4- aur eik Makhool Azdi Basraa bhi hain unka samaa (sun'na), Abdullah bin umr sey Sabit hai un sey Imaara bin Azan riwayat kartey hain. is sanad sey Makhool Shaami key barey mein marvi hai ke jab un sey koi masla puchha jata to wo «"
"2635","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo musalman logon sey mail jol rakhta hai aur un sey pahunchney wali takleefon ko bardasht karta hai wo us musalman sey behtar hai jo na logon sey mel-jol rakhta hai aur na hi unki takleefon ko bardasht karta hai.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ibne-Abi Adi ney kaha : Shoba ka khayal hai ke Sheikh Sahabi (buzurg Sahabi) sey murad ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma hain."
"2636","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''aapsi phoot aur bughz aur adawat ki burai sey ijtinab (bacha) karo kyonkey ye (deen ko) moondney wali hai, aapsi phoot ki burai sey murad aapas ki adawat aur bughz aur hasad hai aur « الحالقة » moondney wali sey murad Deen ko moondney wali hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey sahih gharib hai."
"2637","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''kya main tumhen aisi chiz key barey mein na bata dun jo darje mein salaat (namaz) , saum (roze) aur sadqe sey bhi afzal hai, Sahaba ney arz kiya : kyon nahin? zarur bataiye'' , aap ney farmaya : ''wo aapas mein mel-jol kara dena hai padhi. isliye ke aapas ki phoot Deen ko moondney wali hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees sahih hai. Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey marvi hai ke aap ney farmaya : ''yehi chiz moondney wali hai. main ye nahin keh raha hun ke sar ka baal moondney wali hai balke Deen ko moondney wali hai.''"
"2638","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tumharey andar agli Ummaton ka eik marz ghus aaya hai aur ye hasad aur bughz ki bimari hai, ye moondney wali hai, main ye nahin kehta ke sar ka baal moondney wali hai balke Deen moondney wali hai, qism hai us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai ! tum log jannat mein nahin dakhil ho'o-gey jab tak ke eman na ley aao, aur momin nahin ho saktey yahan tak ke aapas mein mohabbat na karney lago, aur kya main tumhen aisi baat na bata dun jis sey tumharey darmiyan mohabbat qaaim ho : tum salam ko aapas mein phailao.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : Yahya bin Abi Kasir sey is hadees key riwayat karney mein ehle-ilm ka ikhtilaf hai, baaz logon ney ye hadees : (عن يحيى بن أبي كثير an يعيش بن الوليد an مولى الزبير an النبي صلى الله عليه"
"2639","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''bagawat aur qata' rehmi sey badh kar koi gunah aisa nahin hai jiska murtakib (mujrim) ziyada laaiq hai ke us ko Allah ki janib sey duniya mein bhi jald saza di jaey aur aakhirat key liye bhi usey baqi rakha jaey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2640","mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna : ''do khaslatein aisi hain ke jis shakhs key andar wo mojud hongi usey Allah Taala sabir aur shakir likheyga aur jis key andar wo mojud na hongi usey Allah Taala sabir aur shakir nahin likheyga, pehli khaslat ye hai ke jis shakhs ney Deen key aetbar sey apney sey ziyada Deen par amal karney waley ko dekha aur uski perwi ki aur duniya key aetbar sey apney sey kam haisiyat waley ko dekha phir us Fazal aur ehsan ka shukar ada kiya jo Allah ney is par kiya hai to Allah Taala usey sabir aur shakir likheyga. aur dusri khaslat ye hai ke jisney Deen key aetbar sey apney sey kam aur duniya key aetbar sey apney sey ziyada par nazar ki phir jis sey wo mehroom reh gaya hai is par usney afsos kiya, to Allah Taala usey sabir aur shakir nahin likheyga.''"
"2641","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''un logon ki taraf dekho jo duniyaawi aetbar sey tum sey kam tar hon aur un logon ki taraf na dekho jo tum sey ooper hon , is tarah ziyada laaiq hai ke tum Allah ki un nematon ki na-qadri na karo, jo uski taraf sey tum par hui hain.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees sahih hai."
"2642","main Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) key paas sey rotey huye guzra to unhoney kaha : Hanzala ! tumhen kya ho gaya hai? mainey kaha : Abu-Bakar ! Hanzala to munafiq ho gaya hai) baat ye hai) ke jab hum Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas hotey hain, aur aap hamein jahannam aur jannat ki yad is tarah dilaatey hain goya hum usey apni aakhon sey dekh rahey hain, lekin jab hum duniyaawi karobar aur apney bachon mein wapis chaley aatey hain to us nasihat mein sey bahut kuchh bhool jatey hain, Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : Allah ki qism ! hamara bhi yehi haal hai. chalo hamarey sath Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas , chunanche hum dono chal padey, phir jab Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mujhey dekha to farmaya : ''Hanzala ! tumhen kya ho gaya hai?'' mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! Hanzala munafiq ho gaya hai, jab hum aap key paas hotey hain aur aap hamein jahannam aur jannat ki yad is tarah dilaatey hain to wo hamari aakhon key samney hain, lekin jab hum duniyaawi karobar aur apney baal bachchon mein wapis lot jatey hain to bahut si baaten bhool jatey hain. Hanzala kehtey hain : Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''agar tum hamesha isi keyfiyat mein raho jis kaifiyat mein merey paas hotey ho to yaqin jano ke farishtey tumhari majlison mein , tumharey raaston mein aur tumharey bistaron par tum sey musaafa karen  lekin aey Hanzala ! waqt waqt ki baat hai.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2643","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''farqe maraatib key bawajud eik doosrey ko jannati isi tarah nazar ayengey jaisey mashriqi ya maghribi sitaara nazar aata hai, jo ufaq (kshitij) mein nikalney aur doobney wala hai.'' Sahaba ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! kya wo anbiya hongey? aap ney farmaya : ''haan, qism hai us zaat ki jis key haath mein meri jaan hai, aur wo log bhi hongey jo Allah aur uskey Rasool par eman laye aur jinhoney Rasulon ki tasdeeq ki.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2644","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah taala qiyamat key din tamam logon ko eik wasee aur humwaar zamin mein jama kerega, phir Allah Rabbul-Aalameen unkey samney achcha aayega aur kaheyga : kyon nahin har aadmi us chiz key peechhey chala jata hai jiski wo ibadat karta tha? chunanche saleeb poojney walon key samney un ki saleeb ki surat bin jaeygi, but poojney walon key samney buton ki surat bin jaeygi aur aag poojney walon key samney aag ki surat bin jaeygi, phir wo log apney apney mabudon key peechey lag jaeyngey aur musalman thehrey rahengey, phir Rabbul-Aalameen un key paas aayega aur kaheyga : tum bhi logon key sath kyon nahin chaley jatey? wo kahengey : hum tujh sey Allah ki panah maangtey hain, hum tujh sey Allah ki panah maangtey hain, hamara rab Allah Taala hai, hum yahin rahengey yahan tak ke hum apney rab ko dekh lein. Allah Taala unhen hukm dega aur in ko Sabit qadam rakheyga aur chhup jaeyga, phir aayega aur kaheyga : tum bhi logon key sath kyon nahin chaley jatey? wo kahengey : hum tujh sey Allah ki panah maangtey hain, hum tujh sey Allah ki panah maangtey hain, hamara rab Allah hai aur hamari jagah yehi hai yahan tak ke hum apney Rab ko dekh lein, Allah Taala unhen hukm dega aur unhen Sabit qadam rakheyga, Sahaba ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! kya hum Allah Taala ko dekhengey? aap ney farmaya : ''kya chaudahween raat key chaand ko dekhney main tumhen koi rukaawat aur dhakkam-pail hoti hai?'' Sahaba ney arz kiya : nahin, aey Allah key Rasool ! aap ney farmaya : ''tum Allah Taala key dekhney mein us waqt koi rukaawat aur dhakkam-pail nahin karogey. phir Allah Taala chhup jaeyga phir jhaankeyga aur un sey apni shanaakht karaaeyga, phir kaheyga : main tumhara rab hun, merey peechhey aao, chunanche musalman khadey hongey aur pul-siraat qaaim kiya jaeyga, is par sey musalman tez raftaar ghodey aur sawar ki tarah guzrengey aur guzartey huye un sey ye kalimaat ada hongey « سلم سلم » ''salaamat rakh, salaamat rakh'' ,sirf jahannami baqi reh jaeyngey to un mein sey eik giroh ko jahannam mein phenk diya jaeyga, phir puchha jaeyga : kya to bhar gaee? jahannam kahey gi : (هل من مزيد) aur ziyada , phir is mein doosra giroh phenka jaeyga aur puchha jaeyga : kya to bhar gaee? wo kahey gi : (هل من مزيد) aur ziyada , yahan tak ke jab tamam log phenk diye jaeyngey to Rehman is mein apna pair daleyga aur jahannam ka eik hissa doosrey mein simat jaeyga, phir Allah Taala kaheyga : bas. jahannam kaheygi : « qat qat » bas , bas. jab Allah Taala jannatiyon ko jannat mein aur jahannamiyon ko jahannam mein dakhil kar dega, to maut ko khinchtey huye us deewar tak laya jaeyga jo jannat aur jahannam key darmiyan hai, phir kaha jaeyga : aey jannatiyon ! to wo dartey huye jhaankeingey , phir kaha jaeyga : aey jahannamiyon ! to wo shafaat ki ummid mein khush ho kar jhaankeingey, phir jannatiyon aur jahannamiyon sey kaha jaeyga : kya tum isey jantey ho? to ye bhi kahengey aur wo bhi kahengey : hamney isey pehchan liya , ye wohi maut hai jo hamarey ooper wakeel thi, phir wo jannat aur jahannam ki bech wali deewar par litaa kar yakbaargi zibeh kar di jaeygi, phir kaha jaeyga : aey jannatiyon ! hamesha ( jannat mein) rehna hai maut nahin aayegi. aey jahannamiyon ! hamesha ( jahannam mein) rehna hai maut nahin aayegi.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey isi jaisi bahut si ahadees marvi hain jis mein deedare Ilahi ka zikr hai ke log apney rab ko dekhengey , qadam aur isi tarah ki chizon ka bhi zikr hai. 3- is silsiley mein Aaimma ehle-ilm jaisey Sufiyan Sory , Malik bin Anas , ibne-Mubarak , ibne Uena aur Wakee waghera ka maslak ye hai ke wo un chizon ki riwayat kartey hain aur kehtey hain : ye hadisein aai hain aur hum is par eman latey hain, lekin sifaate Bari Taala ki kaifiyat key barey mein kuchh nahin kaha jaeyga, muhaddeseen ka maslak ye yehi ke ye cheezen wesi hi riwayat ki jaeyngi jaisi waarid hui hain, unki na (batil) tafseer ki jaeygi na is mein koi weham paida kiya jaeyga, aur na un ki kaifiyat key barey mein puchha jaeyga, ehle-ilm ney isi maslak ko ikhtiyar kiya hai aur log isi ki taraf gaey hain. 4- hadees key andar « فيعرفهم"
"2645","Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ( ney farmaya : ''qiyamat key din maut ko chitkabrey mendhey ki tarah laya jaeyga aur jannat aur jahannam key darmiyan khadi ki jaeygi phir wo zibeh ki jaeygi, aur jannati aur jahannami dekh rahey hongey, to agar koi khushi sey marney wala hota to jannati mar jatey aur agar koi gham sey marney wala hota to jahannami mar jatey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2646","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jannat naa-pasandida aur takleef deh chizon sey ghiri hui hai aur jahannam shahwaton sey ghiri hui hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib sahih hai."
"2647","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab Allah Taala jannat aur jahannam ko paida kar chuka to Jibreel ko jannat ki taraf bheja aur kaha : jannat aur is mein jannatiyon key liye jo kuchh hamney tayyar kar rakha hai, usey ja kar dekho'' , aap ney farmaya : ''wo aaye aur jannat ko aur jannatiyon key liye Allah Taala ney jo tayyar kar rakha hai usey dekha : ''aap ney farmaya : ''phir Allah key paas wapis gaey aur arz kiya : teri izzat ki qism ! jo bhi uskey barey mein sun ley is mein zarur dakhil hoga, phir Allah ney hukm diya to wo naa-pasandida aur takleef deh chizon sey gher di gaee, aur Allah ney kaha : uski taraf dobara jaao aur is mein jannatiyon key liye hamney jo tayyar kiya hai usey dekho.'' aap ney farmaya : ''Jibreel (Alaihissalam) jannat ki taraf dobara gaey to wo naa-pasandida aur takleef deh chizon sey ghiri hui thi chunanche wo Allah Taala key paas lot kar aaye aur arz kiya : mujhey andesha hai ke is mein koi dakhil hi nahin hoga, Allah ney kaha : jahannam ki taraf jaao aur jahannam ko aur jo kuchh jahannamiyon key liye mainey tayyar kiya hai usey ja kar dekho, (unhoney dekha ke) uska eik hissa doosrey par chadh raha hai, wo Allah key paas aaye aur arz kiya : teri izzat ki qism ! iskey barey mein jo bhi sun ley is mein dakhil nahin hoga. phir Allah ney hukm diya to wo shahwat sey gher di gaee. Allah Taala ney kaha : uski taraf dobara jaao , wo uski taraf dobara gaey aur (wapis aa kar) arz kiya : teri izzat ki qism ! mujhey dar hai ke us sey koi najat nahin paeyga balke is mein dakhil hoga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2648","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jannat aur jahannam key darmiyan behes aur takraar hui, jannat ney kaha : merey andar kamzor aur miskeen dakhil hongey, jahannam ney kaha : merey andar zalim aur mutakabbir dakhil hongey. Allah Taala ney (faisla kartey huye) jahannam sey kaha : to mera azab hai aur main terey zariey jis sey chahunga intiqam lunga aur jannat sey kaha : to meri rehmat hai main terey zariey jis par chahunga reham karunga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2649","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''kam darjey ka jitni wo hai, jis key liye assi hazar khaadim aur behtar biwiyan hongi. uskey liye moti, zamarrud aur yaqut ka khema nasab kiya jaeyga jo maqame jaabiya sey san'aa (Yamen) tak key barabar hoga.''"
"2650","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab momin jannat mein ladkey ki khahish kerega to hamal theherna , wiladat hona aur uski umr badhna ye sab kuch uski khahish key mutabiq eik ghadi mein hoga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. is barey mein ehle-ilm ka ikhtilaf hai, baaz log kehtey hain : jannat mein jima (sambhog) to hoga magar bachcha nahin paida hoga. Taaoos, Mujahid aur Ibrahim Nakhai sey isi tarah marvi hai. 2- Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari kehtey hain ke Is-haq bin Ibrahim bin Raahviya Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki is hadees key barey mein kehtey hain : jab jannat mein momin bachchey ki khahish kerega to ye eik ghadi mein ho jaeyga, jaisey hi wo khahish kerega lekin wo aisi khahish nahin kerega. 4- Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari kehtey hain : Abu-Rizeen Uqeli (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jannati key liye jannat mein koi bachcha nahin hoga. 5- abu-Siddeeq Naaji ka naam Bakr bin Amr hai, inhen Bakr bin Qais bhi kaha jata hai."
"2651","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jannat mein Hoor Ain key liye eik mahfil hogi is mein wo apna naghma aisa buland kerega ke makhluq ney kabhi us jaisi aawaz nahin suni hogi.''  aap ney farmaya : ''wo kahengi : hum hamesha rehney wali hain kabhi fana nahin hongi, hum naaz aur nemat wali hain kabhi mohtaj nahin hongi, hum khush rehney wali hain kabhi naraz nahin hongi, uskey liye khushkhabri aur Mubarak ho uskey liye jo hamarey liye hai aur hum uskey liye hain.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees gharib hai. 2- is bab mein Abu-Hurera , abu Saeed Khudri aur Anas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2652","Yahya bin Abi Kasir aayate-karima : « فهم في روضة يحبرون » ''wo jannat mein khush kar diye jaeyngey'' key barey mein kehtey hain : is sey murad samaa (sun'na), hai aur samaa, ka mafhoom wohi hai jo hadees mein aaya hai ke hoor ain apney naghmey ki aawaz buland kerengi."
"2653","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''teen qism key log mushk key tiley par hongey''  Raavi kehtey hain : mera khayal hai aap ney farmaya : ''qiyamat key din, un par agley aur pichhley rashk kerengey : eik wo aadmi jo raat din mein paanch waqt namaz key liye Azan dey, doosra wo aadmi jo kisi qom ki imaamat karta ho aur wo us sey razi hon aur teesra wo ghulam jo Allah Taala ka aur apney malikon ka haq ada karey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- hum isey sirf Sufiyan Sory ki riwayat sey jantey hain."
"2654","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''teen qism key logon sey Allah Taala mohabbat karta hai : eik wo aadmi jo raat mein uth kar Allah ki kitab ki tilawat karey, doosra wo aadmi jo apney dahiney haath sey sadqa karey aur usey chupaey aur teesra wo aadmi jo kisi sariya mein ho aur haar janey key baad phir bhi dushmanon ka muqabla kerey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey gharib hai, aur ye mehfooz nahin hai. sahih wo riwayat hai jisey Shoba waghera ney : (عن منصور an ربعي بن حراش an زيد بن ظبيان an أبي ذر an النبي صلى الله عليه"
"2655","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''teen qism key logon sey Allah Taala mohabbat karta hai, aur teen qism key logon sey nafrat, jin logon sey Allah Taala mohabbat karta hai wo ye hain : eik wo aadmi jo kisi qom key paas jaey aur un sey Allah ka wasta dey kar maangey wo apney aur us qom key darmiyan paey janey waley kisi rishtey ka wasta dey kar na maangey aur wo log usey kuch na den, phir un mein sey eik aadmi peechhey phirey aur usey chupkey sey la kar kuch dey, uskey Atiya ko Allah Taala aur jis ko diya hai uskey siwa koi na janey. doosrey wo log jo raat ko chalen yahan tak ke jab in ko neend un chizon sey piyari ho jaey jo neend key barabar hain to sawari sey utren aur sar rakh kar so jaeyn aur un mein ka eik aadmi khada ho kar meri khushamad karney aur meri aayaton ki tilawat karney lagey, teesra wo aadmi jo kisi sariya mein ho aur dushman sey muqabla ho to uskey sathi haar jaeyn phir bhi wo Sina sipar ho kar aagey badhey yahan tak ke maara jaey ya Fateh hasil ho jaaey. jin teen logon sey Allah Taala nafrat karta hai wo ye hain : wo boodha jo zina kaar ho, wo faqir jo takabbur karney wala ho aur maaldaar jo dusron par zulm dhaaey.''"
"2656","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''qarib hai ke dariyaaey faraat soney ka khazana ugley , lihaza (us waqt) jo mojud ho wo is mein sey kuch bhi na ley.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2657","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey isi jaisi hadees riwayat ki hai, magar is mein ye farq hai ke aap ney farmaya : ''soney ka pahad ugley.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2658","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jannat mein pani ka samandar hai, shehad ka samandar hai, doodh ka samandar hai aur sharab ka samandar hai, phir uskey baad chhoti chhoti nehren nikalti hain.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2659","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo Allah Taala sey teen baar jannat maangta hai to jannat kehti hai : aey Allah ! isey jannat mein dakhil kar dey, aur jo teen martaba jahannam sey panah maangta hai to jahannam kehti hai : aey Allah is ko jahannam sey najat dey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees isi tarah :(يونس بن أبي إسحق an أبي إسحق an بريد بن أبي مريم an أنس an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) ki sanad sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai. 2- ye hadees : (عن أبي إسحق an بريد بن أبي مريم an أنس بن"
"2660","Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Mere parh jhoot mat bolo.\"""""""
"2661","Anas bin Malik (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jw shkhs amdً mjh pr jhwty hdys mnswb kray\"" – myra khyal hay aap ﷺ nay yh frmaya – \""tw wh apnay lyay jhnm myn apna thkana bna lay۔\"""""""
"2662","Al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai ki Nabi-e-Akram (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Jis shakhs ne meri taraf se aise hadis ki riwayat jo usay pata hai ki woh jhooti hai"
"2663","Anas رضي الله عنه se rivayat hai:\n\nMahmūd ibn Ghaylān ne hamāre liye bayān kiyā, Abū Dāwūd ne hamāre liye bayān kiyā, Shuʿbah aur Hishām ne Qatādah se, aur Qatādah ne Anas رضي الله عنه se rivayat ki ki Rasūlullāh ﷺ ne farmāyā.\n\nHishām ne lafz yeh bayān kiyā: \Woh Jahannum se nikālā jāegā.\""""\n\nAur Shuʿbah ne lafz yeh bayān kiyā: \""""Jahannum se nikālo us shakhs ko jisne *Lā ilāha illā Allāh* (Allāh ke siwā koī maʿbūd nahīn) kahā aur uske dil mein ek jau ke dāne barābar nekī thī. Jahannum se nikālo us shakhs ko jisne *Lā ilāha illā Allāh* kahā aur uske dil mein ek gehūṅ ke dāne barābar nekī thī. Jahannum se nikālo us shakhs ko jisne *Lā ilāha illā Allāh* kahā aur uske dil mein ek zarrah barābar nekī thī.\""""\n\nAur Shuʿbah ne kahā: \""""Ek *dhurrah* barābar\"""" (halkī adā se"
"2664","Al-Miqdam bin Ma'dikarib (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat karte hain ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Suno! Jald hi ek hadith mere paas se ek shakhs ko pahunch jayegi.\"""""""
"2665","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (rzy allh anh) ky rwayt kay mtabq: \hm nay rswl allh (ﷺ) kw lkhnay ky ajazt mangy، lykn aap (ﷺ) nay hmyn ajazt nhyn dy۔\"""""""
"2666","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Ansar mein ek aisa shakhs tha jo Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath baithta tha.\"""""""
"2667","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah Anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek khutba diya. Is hadees mein unhon ne ek qissa bayan farmaya."
"2668","Hammām bin Munabbih ne riwāyat kiyā ke unhone Abū Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ko farmāte hue sunā ke: \Rasūlullāh (ﷺ) ke Sāhabā (رضي الله عنهم) mein se mujhse zyāda Hadīth Rasūlullāh (ﷺ) se kisī ne riwāyat nahīñ kī.\"""""""
"2669","Riwayat Abdullah bin Amr (razi Allahu anhuma) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Mere taraf se phelao...\"""""""
"2670","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya:\n\n\Aik shakhs Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke paas aik sawari talash karne ke liye aaya.\"""""""
"2671","Abu Mas'ud Al-Badri (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh ayk shkhs nby krym ﷺ kay pas swary mangnay aaya۔"
"2672","Abu Musa Al-Ash'ari (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \shfaat krw۔\"""""""
"2673","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \kwyy jan nahq nhyn mary jaty mgr as kay khwn ka kchh bwjh aadm alyh alslam kay bytay (qabyl) pr aayd hwta hay۔\"""""""
"2674","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jo shaks hidaayat ki taraf daawat de...\"""""""
"2675","Ibn Jarir bin Abdullah (rz all anh) apnay bap say rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \js nay kwyy achhy snt shrwa ky js kay bad lwgwn nay as pr aml kya"""""
"2676","Hazrat Al-Irbad bin Sariyah (Razi Allah unho) ne riwayat farmaya:\n\nEk din, Fajr ki namaz ke baad..."
"2677","Hazrat Kathir bin Abdullah (jo bin 'Amr bin 'Awf Al-Musani hain) ne riwayat kiya, apni taraf se ki unhone apne walid se riwayat ki:"
"2678","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne mujh se farmaya: 'Ai mere beta! Agar tum subah aur shaam aise guzaar sakte ho ke...'\"""""""
"2679","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Mujhe us cheez par chhod do jo maine tumhe chhodi hai. Jab maine tumse hadith bayan ki\"""""""
"2680","Abu Salih ne Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنہ) se riwayat ki hai ke:\n\n\Anaqareeb aisa waqt aayega ke log oonton ke pet (livers) pe maarte hue (yaani un par jaldi jaldi safar karte hue) taleem ki talash mein honge. Lekin Madinah ke aalim se zyada ilm wala koi nahi payenge.\"""""""
"2681","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Faqih (Islami ilm rakhne wala) Shaitan par hazaar ibadat karne walon se zyada sakht hota hai.\"""""""
"2682","Qais bin Kathir ne riwayat kiya ke: \Ek shakhs Madinah se Abu Darda (rz all anh) kay pas aaya jb wh Dimashq (dmshq) myn thay۔ anhwn nay pwchha: 'tmhyn ks chyz nay laya aay myray bhtyjay؟' as nay jwab dya: 'aap nay rswl allh (ﷺ) say ayk hdys byan ky hay jw mjh tk phnchy hay۔' anhwn nay kha: 'kya tm ksy zrwrt kay lyay nhyn aayay؟' as nay kha: 'nhyn۔' anhwn nay kha: 'kya tm tjart kay lyay aayay hw؟' as nay kha: 'nhyn۔'"""""
"2683","Abu 'Abdullah, Huraib ibn Mis'ar al-Azdi al-Tirmidhi ne riwayat ki, 'Abd al-'Aziz ibn Muhammad se, Suhayl ibn Abi Salih se, unke walid se, Abu Hurayrah (radiyAllahu 'anhu) se, ke Rasoolullah (sallAllahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne logon ko khutba diya aur naseehat ki, phir farmaya:\n\n\Aai auraton"
"2684","Abu Horaira (raziyallahu anhu) rivayet etti ki: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Munafik mein iki cheezein ek saath nahi ho sakte: Naseehat aur khulq-e-nek.\"""""""
"2685","Abu Umamah Al-Bahili (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saamne do ahadith-e-zindagiyan (ya do shakhs) ka zikr kiya gaya. Ek ibadat karne wala tha aur doosra ilm rakhta tha."
"2686","Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Momin kabhi suni hui neemat se kabhi mutmain nahi hota.\"""""""
"2687","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Hikmat wala qaul momin ka gumshuda maal hai.\"""""""
"2688","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Usi Ta'ale ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Tum jannat mein tabhi dakhil honghe jab tak tum iman na lao.\"""""""
"2689","Imran bin Husain (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay: ayk aadmy nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) kay pas aaya awr kha: \alslam alykm\"" (aap pr slamty hw)۔ aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""ds\""۔ phr dwsray aadmy aaya awr as nay kha: \""alslam alykm wrhm allh\"" (aap pr slamty hw awr allh ky rhmt hw)۔"""""
"2690","Hazrat Abu Sa'eed Khudri (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke: \nHazrat Abu Musa Ash'ari (رضي الله عنه) ne Hazrat Umar (رضي الله عنه) ke paas dakhil hone ki ijazat maangi. Unhon ne kaha: \As-Salamu 'Alaykum – kya main andar aa sakta hoon?\"" Hazrat Umar (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \""Ek baar.\"" Phir kuch der tak khamosh rahe. Phir Hazrat Abu Musa (رضي الله عنه) ne phir kaha: \""As-Salamu 'Alaykum – kya main andar aa sakta hoon?\"" Hazrat Umar (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \""Do baar.\"" Phir kuch der tak khamosh rahe. Phir Hazrat Abu Musa (رضي الله عنه) ne phir kaha: \""As-Salamu 'Alaykum – kya main andar aa sakta hoon?\"" Hazrat Umar (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \""Teen baar.\"" Phir Hazrat Abu Musa (رضي الله عنه) wapas chale gaye. Hazrat Umar (رضي الله عنه) ne darban se pucha: \""Usne kya kiya?\"" Usne jawab diya: \""Woh chale gaye.\"" Hazrat Umar (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \""Use mere paas lao.\"" Jab Hazrat Abu Musa (رضي الله عنه) aaye..."""""
"2691","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat kiya ke Umar bin Al-Khattab (رضي الله عنہ) ne farmaya: \Maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) se teen baar ijazat maangi (dakhil hone ki ijazat talab ki).\"""""""
"2692","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat hai: \Ek shakhs Masjid mein aaya aur Namaz ada ki"
"2693","Abu Salamah ne riwayat ki ke Aisha (رضی اللہ عنہا) ne unhain bataya ke Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne un se farmaya: \Beshak Jibril (علیہ السلام) ne tum par Salaam bheja hai.\"" Aisha (رضی اللہ عنہا) ne kaha: \""Aur us par bhi salam ho aur Allah ki rehmat aur uski barkatein (nazil hon).\"""""""
"2694","Abu Umamah (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke: \Logon ne kaha: 'Ya Rasoolallah! Jab aadmi aadmi se milte hain to phir un mein se afzal amal kaun sa hai?' Aap (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Yahi jannat ke darwaze ko us waqt kholne ke liye aur jahannam ke darwaze ko us waqt band karne ke liye (maslahat karne ke liye).'"""""
"2695","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah Anhu) ki Riwayat:\n\nUnhon ne farmaya: Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya:\n\n> *\Zina karne wala zina karte waqt momin nahi hota; chori karne wala chori karte waqt momin nahi hota. Lekin tauba ka darwaza khula hai.\""""*\n\nRawi: Ahmad ibn Mani' ne hamain hikayat ki — 'Ubaydah ibn Humayd ne hamain hikayat ki — al-A'mash se — Abu Salih se — Abu Hurairah se.\n\nIs mauzoo par mazeed riwayatein Ibn 'Abbas"
"2696","Sayyar (رحمہ اللہ) نے بیان کیا:\n\n\میں ثابت بنانی (رحمہ اللہ) کے ساتھ چل رہا تھا۔ انہوں نے کچھ لڑکوں کے پاس سے گزرے۔\"""""""""""""
"2697","Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (رضي الله عنہا) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne ek din Masjid mein se guzre."
"2698","Hazrat Anas (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ki: \nRasoolullah (ﷺ) ne mujhe farmaya: \Ai mere chhote beta! Jab tum apne ghar waalon ke paas pahunche to salaam phela do.\"""""""
"2699","Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \slam bat krnay say phlay kya jayay۔\"" asy snd say mrwy hay kh nby krym ﷺ nay frmaya: \""ksy kw khanay ky dawt nh dw jb tk slam nh kya jayay۔\"""""""
"2700","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Yahoodiyon aur Nasaron ko Salam se peecha na karo. Aur agar tum mein se kisi ko raaste mein unhe mil jaye"
"2701","Hazrat Aishah (Razi Allahu Anha) se riwayat hai ke ek guruh Yahoodiyon ne Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aake kaha: \As-Samu Alaikum\"" (tum par maut ho). Aap (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Wa Alaikum\"" (aur tum par bhi). Hazrat Aishah (Razi Allahu Anha) ne farmaya: \""Main ne kaha: 'Balke tum par maut aur laanat ho.'\"" Aap (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Aishah! Beshak Allah Ta'ala har kaam mein narmi ko pasand karta hai.\"" Hazrat Aishah (Razi Allahu Anha) ne kaha: \""Kya aap ne nahi suna jo unhone kaha?\"" Aap (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Aur main ne jawab diya: 'Aur tum par bhi.'\"""""""
"2702","Usamah bin Zaid (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym ﷺ ayk aysay mjma say gzray js myn mslman awr yhwdy dwnwn jma thay۔"
"2703","Al-Hasan (rhmh allh) nay abwhryrh (rzy allh anh) say rwayt ky kh nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \n\swar chlnay walay kw slam kray۔\"""""""
"2704","Hammam bin Munabbih ne Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Chhota badh ko Salaam de.\"""""""
"2705","Fadalah bin Ubaid (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Ghoda chalne wala (sawaar) chalne wale (paidal) ko salaam deta hai.\"""""""
"2706","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se kisi ko majlis mein aaye...\"""""""
"2707","Abu Dharr (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Jis shakhs ne parda uthaya ke uski nazar ghar mein ghusne lage"
"2708","Hazrat Anas (rzَ allُ anُ) nay rwayt ky kh nby krym (sl allُ alِ wslm) apnay ghr myn thay، atnay myn ayk shkhs nay an ky trf dykha۔"
"2709","Sahl bin Sa'd As-Sa'idi (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh ayk shkhs nay rswl allh ﷺ kay ghr myn jhank kr dykha۔"
"2710","Hazrat Amr bin Abi Sufyan (Razi Allah Anhu) ne riwayat ki ki, Hazrat Amr bin Abdullah bin Safwan (Razi Allah Anhu) ne unhein ittila farmai."
"2711","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Main ne apne baap ke qarz ke mutabiq Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke paas dakhil hone ki ijazat talab ki.\"""""""
"2712","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne unhein safar ki wapsi ke waqt raat ko apni biwiyon ke paas jaane se mana farmaya."
"2713","Jabir (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jb tm myn say kwyy chyz lkhay...\"""""""
"2714","Zaid bin Thabit (رضي الله عنه) ne farmaya: \Main Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ke paas gaya"
"2715","Zaid bin Thabit (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne mujhe hukm diya ke main Yahoodiyon ke kuch khuoot (likhaawat) se unke chand kalaam seekh kar laon.\"""""""
"2716","hmyn mhmwd bn ghylan ky rwayt ky kh anhwn nay kha: abw asamh nay hm say aamsh kay wastay rwayt ky، anhwn nay abw salh say rwayt ky، awr anhwn nay abwhryrh (allh an say razy hwn) say rwayt ky kh rswl allh (allh ky slwat w brkat an pr hwn) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs alm ky tlb myn rasth tay kray، allh as kay lyay jnt ka rasth aasan kr day ga۔\"" abw aysy (trmzy) nay kha: yh hdys hsn (nyk) hay۔"""""
"2717","Ibn 'Abbas (rz all anhma say rwayt hay kh abwsfyan bn hrb (rz all anh) nay anhyn btaya kh hrql nay anhyn blaya jb wh qrysh kay ayk grwh kay sath thay۔"
"2718","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh jb allh kay nby (ﷺ) ghyr mslm dshmnwn kw kht lkhna chahtay۔"
"2719","Al-Miqdad bin Al-Aswad (رضي الله عنه) se marfoo' taur par rivaayat hai ki unhone farmaya: \Main aur mere do saathiyon ne apne aap ko Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke Sahaba (رضي الله عنهم) ke saamne pesh kiya.\"""""""
"2720","Hazrat Ibn-e-Umar (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh ayk shkhs nay rswl allh (ﷺ) kw slam dya awr as wqt aap (ﷺ) pyshab kr rhay thay۔"
"2721","Arabi Matn\n\nحَدَّثَنَا قُتَيْبَةُ، حَدَّثَنَا نُوحُ بْنُ قَيْسٍ، عَنْ أَبِي هَارُونَ الْعَبْدِيِّ، عَنْ أَبِي سَعِيدٍ الْخُدْرِيِّ، عَنِ النَّبِيِّ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ: \يَأْتِيكُمْ رِجَالٌ مِنْ قِبَلِ الْمَشْرِقِ يَتَعَلَّمُونَ فَإِذَا جَاءُوكُمْ فَاسْتَوْصُوا بِهِمْ خَيْرًا\"""". قَالَ فَكَانَ أَبُو سَعِيدٍ إِذَا رَآنَا قَالَ مَرْحَبًا بِوَصِيَّةِ رَسُولِ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم. قَالَ هَذَا حَدِيثٌ لاَ نَعْرِفُهُ إِلاَّ مِنْ حَدِيثِ أَبِي هَارُونَ عَنْ أَبِي سَعِيدٍ الْخُدْرِيِّ.\n\n\n\nUloomi Roman Urdu Tarjuma\n\nHazrat Qutaybah (rahimahullāh) ne ham se riwāyat kī: Hazrat Nuḥ ibn Qays (rahimahullāh) ne ham se riwāyat kī"
"2722","Abu Ghifar Muthanna bin Sa'eed Ta'i riwayat karte hain ke Abu Tamimah Hujaimi ne Jabir bin Sulaim se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: \nMain Nabi ﷺ ke paas aaya aur maine kalaam kiya: *\Alaikas-Salam\""* (tum par aman ho). \nAap ﷺ ne farmaya: *\""Alaikas-Salam mat kaho"
"2723","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya:\n\n\Jab Rasoolullah (ﷺ) Salaam pherte to teen baar pherte.\"""""""
"2724","Abu Waqid Al-Laithi (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya ke: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) Masjid mein baithe the aur log unke saath the, jab teen aaye. Do Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke paas aaye aur ek chala gaya. Jab dono ne Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke paas ruk kar Salaam kiya. Ek ne halqeh mein jagah dekhi aur wahan baith gaya. Doosra..."
"2725","Riʿāyat: ʿAbdullāh ibn ʿUmar (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhumā) ne riwāyat kiyā:\n\nNabī ﷺ ne farmāyā:\n\n> *\Jis ne Allāh ke siwā kisī aur wāste ʿilm ḥāṣil kiyā"
"2726","Zayd ibn Thabit (Razi Allah un se) ne riwayat farmaya:\n\nMahmoud ibn Ghaylan ne humein riwayat ki, Abu Dawud ne khabar di, Shu'bah ne khabar di, 'Umar ibn Sulayman — 'Umar ibn al-Khattab (Razi Allah un se) ke vansaj se — ne kaha: Maine 'Abdur-Rahman ibn Aban ibn 'Uthman ko apni taraf se riwayat karte suna, unhone apne walid se riwayat ki, unhone kaha:\n\nZayd ibn Thabit (Razi Allah un se) dophar ke waqt Marwan ke paas se nikle. Humne kaha: \Is waqt unhone unhein bulaya hi isliye hoga ke unhone kuch poochha ho.\"""" Hum khade hue aur unhone un se poocha"
"2727","Al-Bara bin 'Azib (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jb dw mslman ayk dwsray say mlyn awr hath mlayyn"""""
"2728","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh ayk shkhs nay arz kya: \ya rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm)! hm myn say jb kwyy shkhs apnay bhayy ya dwst say mlaqat kray، tw kya asay jhkna chahyay؟\"" aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""nhyn۔\"" as shkhs nay pwchha: \""kya asay glay lgana awr chwmna chahyay؟\"" aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""nhyn۔\"" as nay arz kya: \""kya as ka hath pkr kr hath mlna chahyay؟\"" aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""han۔\"""""""
"2729","Qatadah (rhmh allh) nay rwayt krtay hyway kh anhwn nay hzrt ans bn malk (rzy allh anh) say pwchha: \kya rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) kay shabh (rzwan allh alyhm ajmayn) ayk dwsray ka hath mlaya krtay thay؟\"" anhwn nay frmaya:"""""
"2730","Ibn Mas'ud (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Haath pakarna salam ki kamaliat mein se hai.\"""""""
"2731","Abu Umamah (raziyallahu 'anhu) rivayti hain ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Mariz ki mukammal ziyarat is baat ki hai ki tum se kisi ek apna uske maathhe par rukhe\"" — ya farmaya — \""uske haath par.\"""""""
"2732","Hazrat Aishah (R.A.) ne riwayat farmaya: \Zaid bin Harithah (R.A.) Madinah Munawwara pahunche jabke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) apne ghar mein tayyar the. Woh aaye aur darwaze par dastak di.\"""""""
"2733","Safwan bin Assal (R.A.) ne riwayat ki:\n\nEk Yahoodi ne apne saathi se kaha: \Chalo"
"2734","Umm Hani ne riwayat ki: \Main Fatah ke saal Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ke paas gayi."""""
"2735","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''koi shakhs momin kamil nahin ho sakta yahan tak ke wo apney bhai key liye wohi pasand karey jo apni zaat key liye pasand karta hai.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees sahih hai."
